    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0e0000000e0000001500000016000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: If I remember correctly, $$your birthday is the 5th of April, $$right?
